# The pinned python:3.13-slim build can leave third-party scanner metadata for
# msgpack 1.1.2 even though the Dockerfile uninstalls the distribution and then
# fails the image build if importlib.metadata can still find it. Trivy reports
# the stale package metadata as the advisory below. Keep this exception scoped
# to the exact advisory and remove it when the base/build scan no longer emits
# the false positive.
